on" class="place-map-btn" onclick="toggleMapBox(this)">🧭 View on Map</button><div class="map-box" style="display:none;margin-top:10px"><iframe width="100%" height="200" style="border:0;border-radius:8px;display:block" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" data-src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=31.2614,77.4372&z=15&output=embed"></iframe><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=31.2614,77.4372" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-link">Open in Google Maps →</a></div></div><div class="place-card"><h3>Glen</h3><div class="place-tag-row"><span>1,830 m</span><span>4 km from the Ridge</span></div><ul class="place-facts"><li>Quiet forested hollow with a small stream through deodar cover</li><li>Easy, shaded walk down from Mall Road</li><li>Passes the old Cecil Hotel and Kennedy House</li><li>Popular half-day picnic spot, quieter by afternoon</li></ul><button type="button" class="place-map-btn" onclick="toggleMapBox(this)">🧭 View on Map</button><div class="map-box" style="display:none;margin-top:10px"><iframe width="100%" height="200" style="border:0;border-radius:8px;display:block" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" data-src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=31.1177,77.1546&z=15&output=embed"></iframe><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=31.1177,77.1546" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-link">Open in Google Maps →</a></div></div><div class="place-card"><h3>Summer Hill</h3><div class="place-tag-row"><span>2,123 m</span><span>5 km from the Ridge</span></div><ul class="place-facts"><li>One of Shimla's original residential suburbs, on a gentler slope</li><li>Home to Himachal Pradesh University</li><li>Quiet lanes between old colonial bungalows and campus housing</li><li>Cafés cater to a student crowd rather than tour groups</li></ul><button type="button" class="place-map-btn" onclick="toggleMapBox(this)">🧭 View on Map</button><div class="map-box" style="display:none;margin-top