map-box" style="display:none;margin-top:10px"><iframe width="100%" height="200" style="border:0;border-radius:8px;display:block" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" data-src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=31.1372,77.2264&z=15&output=embed"></iframe><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=31.1372,77.2264" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-link">Open in Google Maps →</a></div></div><div class="place-card"><h3>Naldera</h3><div class="place-tag-row"><span>3,044 m</span><span>22 km from Shimla</span></div><ul class="place-facts"><li>One of India's oldest golf courses (nine holes), laid out by Lord Curzon in 1903</li><li>Broad grassy plateau ringed by deodar forest</li><li>Surrounding villages hold temples in distinctive hill architecture</li><li>Popular half-day trip from Shimla</li></ul><button type="button" class="place-map-btn" onclick="toggleMapBox(this)">🧭 View on Map</button><div class="map-box" style="display:none;margin-top:10px"><iframe width="100%" height="200" style="border:0;border-radius:8px;display:block" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" data-src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=31.1642,77.2528&z=15&output=embed"></iframe><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=31.1642,77.2528" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-link">Open in Google Maps →</a></div></div><div class="place-card"><h3>Fagu</h3><div class="place-tag-row"><span>2,510 m</span><span>22 km from Shimla</span></div><ul class="place-facts"><li>Small, quiet hamlet surrounded by apple orchards</li><li>Recognised trekking stage toward Shali Peak and Churdhar</li><li>Sweeping Himalayan views, far less developed than Kufri or Narkanda</li></ul><button type="button" class="place-map-btn" onclick="toggleMapBox(this)">🧭 View on Map</button><div class="map-box" style="display:none;margin-top:10px"><iframe width="100%" height="200" style="border:0;border-radius:8px;display:block" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy